1738 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Given limited engineering resources\054 introducing UI snippets into chat responses appeared as a burden for V1\056 To build confidence\054 I began researching generative UI\056 \nI built a prototype that used CopilotKit to connect chat prompts to the user\031s current UI context\054 then sends that context through a Codex shim that chooses an approved React component and returns structured data for it\056\nWith a prototype in place\054 the engineering team was able to build a more scalable solution with a forked CopilotKit repo\056)
     /K [ 25 ]
     /P 1739 0 R
     /Pg 1688 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

