1742 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As data sources are continually updated\054 it became essential for users to understand how each response was derived\056 Exposing a model\031s thinking did not help\073 even smarter models tend to \030meander\031 towards a finding\056 \nThe challenge wasn\031t transparency\054 but the effort spent on verification\056\nRather than refining a model\031s thought process visibility\054 I explored a conclusion\055derivation response approach\056 The system responds with an answer and produces a concise scannable evidence\057decision trail\056)
     /K [ 27 ]
     /P 1743 0 R
     /Pg 1688 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

