  << /ActualText (Trace resulted in a feature request for users to take a snapshot of the response along with its trace to drop into slack\054 salesforce notes\054 and email threads\056 \nA typical response included a terse conclusion\054 a structured data\055table\054 which combined with a clear step by step derivation made for a complete set needed to begin grounded discussions with peers\056 )
     /K [ 39 ]
