1772 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Progress begins somewhere between blind acceptance and complete dismissal\056\nIt was certainly uncomfortable being yet another team trying to add a chatbot with tiny chips that simulate \034thinking\035 and treat citations as checkboxes\056 But acknowledging discomfort while taking action led to some of the more unique experiences in the application\054 with a lasting impact\056\nThe question was never \034how do we add a chatbot\077\035 but rather \034what assumptions do we carry about the chatbot experience that will fail our users\077\035)
     /K [ 42 ]
     /P 1773 0 R
     /Pg 1688 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

